count(*)    
4     

Query plan:
nl-join (left outer join)
    edge:  term[?]
    outer: sscan
               class: td node[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    inner: temp
               order: UNORDERED
               subplan: nl-join (cross join)
                            outer: sscan
                                       class: tc node[?]
                                       cost:  ? card ?
                            inner: sscan
                                       class: ta node[?]
                                       cost:  ? card ?
                            cost:  ? card ?
               cost:  ? card ?
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select count(*) from ta ta cross join tc tc right outer join td td on td.ca=tc.ca
